flowchart TD

    A[Pet Owner] --> B[PawPal+ Streamlit App]

    B --> C[Owner Information]
    B --> D[Pet Information]
    B --> E[Care Tasks]
    B --> F[Available Time Constraints]

    C --> G[Scheduling Engine]
    D --> G
    E --> G
    F --> G

    G --> H[Task Prioritization]
    H --> I[Schedule Generation]

    I --> J{Tasks Fit Available Time?}

    J -- Yes --> K[Create Daily Schedule]
    J -- No --> L[Move Tasks to Postponed List]

    K --> M[24-Hour Schedule Table]
    L --> M

    M --> N[Schedule Reasons Log]

    M --> O[RAG AI Assistant]

    N --> O

    O --> P[Retrieve Schedule Context]
    P --> Q[AI Question Answering]

    Q --> R[Guardrail Validation]

    R --> S{Response Grounded in Schedule?}

    S -- Yes --> T[Display AI Response]
    S -- No --> U[Return Warning / No Answer]

    T --> V[Pet Owner Reviews Schedule]

    W[Pytest Automated Tests] --> G
    W --> R

    X[Error Handling & Logging] --> O
    X --> G